  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fbbb32557779e4043b7ca4ef0470528c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Jester Dialogue 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Jester:Okay, okay, you win! Jeez!
  - "Jester:I\u2019m done throwing bombs, so for the love of everything that is holy
    will you PLEASE get away from my turret."
  - "Jester:What are you even here for anyway? Just to mock me or something? Don\u2019t
    you have anything better to do than-"
  - "Jester:The bell you\u2019ve got with you\u2026 don\u2019t tell me their royal
    pratness is resorting to sending out commoners to recruit more commoners."
  - Dahlia:...?
  - Jester:...No? Well, I guess it was always beyond them to get anything done.
  - "Jester:I hate to break whatever utopian reality you were in, but anything you\u2019ve
    heard about our ruler\u2026 I mean, look around you! This is what happens when
    you give a crown to an air-head."
  - "Jester:I hate to break whatever utopian reality you were in, but anything you\u2019ve
    heard about our ruler\u2026 I mean, look around you! This is what happens when
    you give a crown to an air-head."
  - Jester:How many deaths do you think you as people have caused for the God of
    Death acolytes? How many people have you terrorized into the streets, begging
    for simply food and water to survive?
  - "Jester:What makes them think that a ritual to stop the God of Death would bring
    back the God of Life? People with their fickle minds and flippant behaviors\u2026
    you can\u2019t just undo the damage you\u2019ve caused!"
  - "Jester:But what do I know? I\u2019m just the jester that has to pay their dues
    to keep their assets. But let\u2019s go ahead and kick them out too, instead
    of laughing at their \u201Cillogical\u201D ideas."
  - Jester:But no, instead of fixing your mistakes, you rely on a God, who is cast
    to who knows where, to suppress the God that kicked it out. Sure, that makes
    PERFECT sense.
  - Dahlia:...
  - Jester:But, I digress.
  - "Jester:You know, as rude as you\u2019ve been with that turret, you\u2019re not
    half bad with it. So, I\u2019ll make you a deal."
  - "Jester:I\u2019ve made this spot pretty safe, but it's getting a bit suffocating
    being stuck here all the time.."
  - "Jester:Now, I\u2019m not going out with all those monsters roaming about, but
    clearly you\u2019re crazy enough to. And crazy enough to shoot an innocent bystander,
    it seems."
  - "Jester:Now, I\u2019m not going out with all those monsters roaming about, but
    clearly you\u2019re crazy enough to. And crazy enough to shoot an innocent bystander,
    it seems."
  - "Jester:So, if you\u2019ll use those turret skills against something warranted,
    namely the monsters, I\u2019ll keep any turrets you have safe and in good condition.
    I\u2019ll even let you use one of mine! Isn\u2019t that generous?"
  - Dahlia:Really?
  - "Jester:Ah ah ah - you still have to be careful with it! If the turret is in
    the same condition as my tent - that you blew up, may I remind you - be prepared
    for another fight. Except you won\u2019t have a turret to help you. Got it?"
  - Dahlia:Yes sir!
  - Jester:Good. Come pick it up when you're ready.
